    <item>
      <title>World Pangolin Day 2026: 500,000+ pangolins seized globally between 2016 and 2024</title>
      <link>https://www.downtoearth.org.in/wildlife-biodiversity/world-pangolin-day-2026-500000-pangolins-seized-globally-between-2016-and-2024</link>
      <description>A CITES report reveals over 500,000 pangolins were seized globally from 2016 to 2024, highlighting China and Vietnam as major destinations. The report stresses the need for better enforcement and species identification to combat trafficking, as all eight pangolin species face high extinction risks.</description>
